WEBVTT

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.030
I'll take a look ahead.

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.700
Stand by.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:14.910
Got it.

00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:18.080
Yuito.

00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:20.000
Hey, guys.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:22.710
How are you feeling now?

00:00:22.710 --> 00:00:26.500
My memory is intact.
At least, I think it is.

00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:28.260
And if necessary,

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:29.800
I have this.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:33.720
That's kind of scary.

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.640
Yeah.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:39.060
That was prescribed
by the OSF Hospital, but...

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.940
I found them in the abandoned subway.

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:45.980
Is it some kind of medication?

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:51.320
You probably shouldn't take that unless
your condition dramatically worsens.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.120
Yeah, I'll remember that.

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:56.530
It must be around here.

00:00:56.530 --> 00:01:01.670
This is where OSF deserters
were seen after they came to Seiran.

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:06.000
What were they doing in such a place?

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.370
<i>A crime in reality</i>

00:01:44.370 --> 00:01:45.670
<i>For Heaven's sake</i>

00:01:45.670 --> 00:01:47.590
<i>Accepts any fake</i>

00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.010
<i>And disappears</i>

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:53.090
<i>Piling the eternity in fantasy</i>

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:54.630
<i>Won't take it at all</i>

00:01:54.630 --> 00:01:55.720
<i>I get sick</i>

00:01:55.720 --> 00:01:57.640
<i>A girl looking back</i>

00:01:57.640 --> 00:02:00.060
<i>Casts the miracle</i>

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.020
<i>Into the instant world </i>

00:02:03.020 --> 00:02:07.900
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:07.900 --> 00:02:09.730
<i>Did you lie?</i>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:12.820
<i>Spit the venom </i>

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:17.570
<i>I know why</i>

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:21.160
<i>I've found a game of ecstasy</i>

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:23.790
<i>Red Criminal gets life</i>

00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:26.250
<i>I've never been in love</i>

00:02:26.250 --> 00:02:32.090
<i>Don't know when I started</i>
<i>getting sick of this world</i>

00:02:32.090 --> 00:02:33.670
<i>We will fly</i>

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.510
<i>Someday I won't be crying</i>

00:02:36.510 --> 00:02:41.350
<i>I've been sacrificing myself</i>

00:02:41.350 --> 00:02:43.770
<i>Not to hurt anybody</i>

00:02:59.660 --> 00:03:02.740
There's nobody around.

00:03:02.740 --> 00:03:07.290
I wonder if that report
about deserters was wrong.

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:09.580
Let's look around a bit more.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.090
Our only choice is
to carry out the mission.

00:03:13.090 --> 00:03:16.970
Right. Until we decide
our next move, that is.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:23.520
I intend to right the wrongs
of the New Himukan regime.

00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:27.230
What do you mean?

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:31.270
Karen and I have become like of mind.

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:37.070
My fiancée, Alice, looked into why
people were turning into Others.

00:03:37.070 --> 00:03:40.410
Once personality rehabilitation and
metamorphosis were uncovered,

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:43.120
Karen and I vowed to change this nation.

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:47.370
The two of us were close to
the reins of power, after all.

00:03:47.370 --> 00:03:51.960
But Karen is not the type that
endears himself to his superiors.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:57.800
That's why I took the role of mobilizing
the OSF as ordered by the top.

00:03:59.050 --> 00:04:04.850
Now that Karen is gone, there's no need
to play the role of government pawn.

00:04:04.850 --> 00:04:09.600
There must be another means than his
to right the wrongs of this nation.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.350
Another means?

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:14.820
What are you planning to do?

00:04:14.820 --> 00:04:18.150
This nation is using
illegal human experiments

00:04:18.150 --> 00:04:21.570
in a reckless attempt to
conduct psionics research.

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:24.580
We must expose that to the light of day.

00:04:24.580 --> 00:04:30.040
After all, the people don't know such
terrible things are being done in secret.

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:37.210
Exposing such secrets won't immediately
right this nation's wrongs.

00:04:37.210 --> 00:04:40.800
But it is bound to be the spark
that lights a fire.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.390
Major General Karen is
working from the outside,

00:04:43.390 --> 00:04:48.180
and you are working from
the inside to change this nation.

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:50.850
Yes, exactly.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:55.320
Major General Fubuki, please let me help!

00:04:55.320 --> 00:04:57.280
I'll speak with my brother.

00:04:57.280 --> 00:04:59.190
Please, let me try!

00:05:00.450 --> 00:05:03.110
I don't think that's a good idea.

00:05:03.110 --> 00:05:07.990
Chief Sumeragi may be your brother,
but he's also a member of the government.

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.160
But...!

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:12.170
I can't just sit here!

00:05:12.170 --> 00:05:13.460
Yuito.

00:05:15.130 --> 00:05:17.420
What they did to Naomi...

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.260
...and to Nagi...

00:05:21.880 --> 00:05:23.930
It was wrong!

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:26.680
Please, Major General Fubuki!

00:05:28.390 --> 00:05:31.600
Yuito, you are a commander.

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:34.560
Poke your nose into
the government's secrets,

00:05:34.560 --> 00:05:37.860
and you endanger
your platoon members, too.

00:05:37.860 --> 00:05:39.150
Do you understand?

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:42.490
Then please remove me as commander!

00:05:42.490 --> 00:05:44.110
I cannot do that.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:45.910
But...

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:49.080
In that case...

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.420
...as his platoon members,
we all have to be willing participants.

00:05:53.420 --> 00:05:55.250
I want in.

00:05:55.250 --> 00:05:56.420
Me, too.

00:05:58.380 --> 00:06:01.840
I feel sorry for Naomi.

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:06.720
I will never forgive the government
if they are involved.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:09.430
Please let me help as well.

00:06:10.470 --> 00:06:12.810
Thanks, guys.

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:17.400
Okay, if that's how strongly you feel,
I'll have you join in.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:19.070
Thank you!

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:22.530
But I will come up with the plan.

00:06:22.530 --> 00:06:25.610
Until then, keep fulfilling your duties.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:26.950
Got it?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:32.950
I see.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:36.120
A new security plan for Arahabaki.

00:06:36.120 --> 00:06:40.380
We can't afford another event
like the Suoh Incident.

00:06:40.380 --> 00:06:45.300
I'd like to enter the secure site
and verify the system myself.

00:06:48.180 --> 00:06:49.600
All right.

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:55.060
I'll have Central Control
issue you an entry pass.

00:06:55.060 --> 00:06:56.980
Thank you.

00:07:01.230 --> 00:07:04.280
They're coming! Above us--12 o'clock!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:10.280
You're not what we're looking for,
but oh well...

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:24.380
Yuito!

00:07:24.380 --> 00:07:26.470
Are you okay, Yuito?

00:07:26.470 --> 00:07:30.260
Abnormal brainwaves! Don't use psionics!

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:31.600
Yuito!

00:07:44.030 --> 00:07:45.320
Are you okay?

00:07:45.320 --> 00:07:48.110
S-Sound is the messenger.
Dragonfly contrast.

00:07:48.110 --> 00:07:49.410
Wh-What?!

00:07:49.410 --> 00:07:53.200
Azuma... wild. Lower... dine?

00:07:53.200 --> 00:07:56.710
Yuito? What's wrong?

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.420
What the...? When I speak...

00:07:58.420 --> 00:08:01.210
A-Apple... Return home...

00:08:01.210 --> 00:08:02.840
Are you all right?!

00:08:11.640 --> 00:08:13.010
Get him out of here!

00:08:15.600 --> 00:08:18.600
Just a bit further.

00:08:18.600 --> 00:08:20.850
Wait here.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:24.020
Damn it. It's like my
head's gonna explode.

00:08:35.700 --> 00:08:38.660
The Kunad Gate's growth rate
is increasing.

00:08:38.660 --> 00:08:40.040
What's this?

00:08:40.040 --> 00:08:41.370
What is it?

00:08:41.370 --> 00:08:45.840
It seems to be responding to
some sort of external force.

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:55.850
Yuito?

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:02.150
No response from Naomi yet?

00:09:14.490 --> 00:09:17.790
What's in these ampules?

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.880
D-Damn it!

00:09:28.590 --> 00:09:31.630
It's no use. My psionics don't work.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:35.970
Yuito!

00:09:40.060 --> 00:09:42.520
There's no other choice!

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:49.610
Tsugumi!

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.200
I'll take a look.

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:55.530
The abnormal brainwaves are fading.

00:09:56.950 --> 00:09:58.080
Whoa.

00:09:58.080 --> 00:09:59.330
Yuito!

00:10:28.360 --> 00:10:31.610
No abnormalities in any of your stats.

00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:33.530
How do you feel, Yuito?

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:36.070
Yeah, I feel fine now.

00:10:36.070 --> 00:10:37.820
What a relief.

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:40.660
I'm glad I took that drug.

00:10:40.660 --> 00:10:43.960
Honestly, I was useless without it.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:45.620
All right, then.

00:10:45.620 --> 00:10:50.090
Can we consider that drug to be safe now?

00:10:50.090 --> 00:10:54.050
Well, it smelled funny
and tasted really gross, but...

00:10:55.380 --> 00:10:58.220
Wait. Something's there.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:11:01.350
Wataru, anything you tell us over there?

00:11:01.350 --> 00:11:04.890
The Extinction Belt overhead is too dense.
I can't get a reading.

00:11:04.890 --> 00:11:07.850
What else can you tell me?

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.940
Trucks...

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.520
I think.

00:11:11.520 --> 00:11:12.730
Two of them.

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:15.570
They're heading toward Seiran.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.700
What is it?

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:23.830
Nothing. I thought I saw something.

00:11:23.830 --> 00:11:25.620
Got 'em!

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:29.580
They're transport trunks
registered to the Seiran Regional Force.

00:11:29.580 --> 00:11:31.170
They came from Togetsu.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.300
Togetsu?

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:35.340
That's the moon worshipers' city.

00:11:35.340 --> 00:11:39.720
Right. It's a theocratic autonomous zone.

00:11:39.720 --> 00:11:40.930
Kagero.

00:11:40.930 --> 00:11:45.060
Oh, right. Kagero is from Togetsu.

00:11:45.060 --> 00:11:49.940
In any event, our quarry has surfaced.

00:12:06.080 --> 00:12:07.620
The trucks.

00:12:07.620 --> 00:12:09.170
Yeah.

00:12:09.170 --> 00:12:10.920
I'll have a look.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:20.470
There's absolutely no information
on that facility.

00:12:20.470 --> 00:12:22.390
What could it be?

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:27.680
It's pretty far from the city,
but could it belong to Seiran?

00:12:27.680 --> 00:12:29.810
I don't like this.

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.770
Wait. Luka found something,
and it's not good.

00:12:32.770 --> 00:12:33.310
What?

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:34.570
What's not good?

00:12:38.070 --> 00:12:42.070
I found out what those
trucks were hauling.

00:12:53.540 --> 00:12:55.380
No way.

00:12:55.380 --> 00:13:00.300
All the trucks were full of these.

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.510
My eyes didn't deceive me.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:04.550
What's going on?

00:13:08.930 --> 00:13:11.270
Okay, let's move.

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:17.400
Hey, what're you--?!

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:25.030
Anything?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.950
Yes, a key card.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:37.590
What is this place?

00:13:38.590 --> 00:13:41.220
Some sort of production line?

00:13:44.430 --> 00:13:47.470
I take it their contents
are the same as the others?

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.560
You mean all of these?

00:13:52.560 --> 00:13:55.520
They're all human brains?

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.900
What is this place?

00:13:57.900 --> 00:13:59.940
Are they...

00:13:59.940 --> 00:14:02.320
...manufacturing brains?

00:14:02.320 --> 00:14:06.320
What are they doing with them?

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:10.080
That smell, it's kind of familiar.

00:14:10.080 --> 00:14:14.790
The smell? It kind of smells like blood.

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.540
Don't tell me...

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.600
What the hell?

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:36.690
This is the drug made by
Spring Pharmaceuticals.

00:14:36.690 --> 00:14:38.770
Hang in there, Yuito.

00:14:39.820 --> 00:14:41.480
It can't be.

00:14:46.530 --> 00:14:48.370
Yuito's platoon is here?

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:51.240
So it seems. What now?

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:59.670
Hey, what's the plan?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:04.590
Yuito and the others are on to us.

00:15:06.180 --> 00:15:12.520
I won't be able to protect my sister
if the research facility is exposed.

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:18.060
Damn!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:19.360
Yuito!

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.780
Kasane!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:28.410
Sorry, Tsugumi.
I hoped it wouldn't come to this.

00:15:30.200 --> 00:15:34.200
What the hell is this, Kasane?!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:37.210
Haven't you figured it out by now?

00:15:37.210 --> 00:15:40.960
This is Spring Pharmaceuticals'
Seiran plant.

00:15:41.960 --> 00:15:45.050
Or more precisely,
it's an Other's research facility

00:15:45.050 --> 00:15:49.510
jointly operated by my family
and the Nation of Seiran.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:55.560
Kasane, do you know
what goes on in this place?

00:15:55.560 --> 00:15:57.440
Of course I do.

00:15:57.440 --> 00:16:02.980
What's in these ampules
you've been injecting into Naomi?

00:16:04.110 --> 00:16:06.280
It's made from human brains.

00:16:07.990 --> 00:16:10.240
Did you say brains?

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:12.990
You've been giving <i>that </i>to my sister?

00:16:12.990 --> 00:16:16.830
This facility is researching
an Other Weapon

00:16:16.830 --> 00:16:20.040
for the final battle against New Himuka.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.790
An Other Weapon?

00:16:21.790 --> 00:16:25.840
The plan was to transplant
a human brain into an Other

00:16:25.840 --> 00:16:31.390
and have a psionics user's
brain control it via SAS.

00:16:31.390 --> 00:16:37.600
But they ended up using Others
derived from more compatible humans.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:40.850
That required the drug
contained in these ampules.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:43.440
It stabilizes a psionic's brain.

00:16:44.440 --> 00:16:47.240
If you're trying to use my sister
as an Other Weapon--

00:16:47.240 --> 00:16:51.280
It's no more than a means
to keep Seiran happy.

00:16:51.280 --> 00:16:58.410
This facility's true purpose is to change
human-derived Others back to human form.

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:02.210
Did you really think
you'd get away with this?!

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:05.920
You must kill me.

00:17:05.920 --> 00:17:10.220
Kill me! Save the world!

00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:15.390
If you're a part of this, Kasane,
then you really did kill my father.

00:17:29.280 --> 00:17:30.490
Damn you!

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:51.130
Kasane, are you really
trying to kill Yuito?

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:55.470
It's not only New Himuka.
There's something wrong with Seiran, too!

00:17:55.470 --> 00:17:59.310
They're mass-producing a drug
that uses human brains.

00:17:59.310 --> 00:18:04.480
But there's no way
to save my sister without it.

00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.940
Naomi?

00:18:05.940 --> 00:18:09.070
It <i>does </i>sound unforgivable.

00:18:10.530 --> 00:18:16.120
But there's someone who's
desperate enough to tolerate it.

00:18:17.660 --> 00:18:21.080
I <i>will </i>protect my sister.

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:40.100
Pull out! Luka!

00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:46.190
Arashi! Why'd you do that?!
What if word of this place gets out?!

00:18:47.690 --> 00:18:53.780
Kasane, care to share your thoughts on
what the ampule's drug is made from?

00:18:53.780 --> 00:18:56.870
Kasane has yet to make up her mind.

00:18:56.870 --> 00:18:58.660
Same as us.

00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.700
Do we really have to kill Yuito?

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:06.120
And should we really take Seiran's side?

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:11.460
Sis?

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:20.100
Sis?

00:19:20.100 --> 00:19:22.850
I didn't know.

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:27.770
I can't believe that's what
the drug is made from.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:30.820
She found out.

00:19:30.820 --> 00:19:36.490
I overheard lab personnel
talking about it.

00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:40.700
They said Yuito and his platoon saw it!

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:43.290
Calm down, Sis!

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:46.080
I can't take this anymore!

00:19:46.080 --> 00:19:53.000
Now that I know it's human brains,
I told them I don't want it anymore.

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:55.590
I don't need that awful drug!

00:20:02.350 --> 00:20:03.890
Sis.

00:20:03.890 --> 00:20:05.810
The truth's hard to bear.

00:20:05.810 --> 00:20:12.440
But it's also true that the ampules are
the only reason we can talk like this.

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:15.650
Yes, you're right.

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:17.610
But brains?

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:22.620
That makes me no different than an Other.

00:20:22.620 --> 00:20:26.500
That's not true! You're my sister!

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:30.630
Thank you, Kasane.

00:20:30.630 --> 00:20:35.050
I don't mean to complain, but...

00:20:36.210 --> 00:20:39.090
This is so hard for me.

00:20:39.090 --> 00:20:41.680
I can't take it anymore.

00:20:41.680 --> 00:20:46.770
I don't want to live
if it has to be like this.

00:20:46.770 --> 00:20:51.270
Hang in there.
We'll find a way to turn you back.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:56.440
So... So don't give up on living.

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:59.240
I'm sorry, Kasane.

00:20:59.240 --> 00:21:03.660
Please. I want to be alone.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:10.540
Sis.

00:21:13.710 --> 00:21:17.300
Thanks. I feel better now.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.420
You really shouldn't overdo it.

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.430
You gotta be careful.

00:21:21.430 --> 00:21:24.890
Right. Thanks, guys.

00:21:24.890 --> 00:21:27.890
For now, let's wait here
for Major General Fubuki.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:33.310
Do you think he called us here
because he decided on the next move?

00:21:34.310 --> 00:21:37.320
That ampule factory...

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:41.610
Major General Fubuki is connected
to Spring Pharmaceuticals.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:45.370
It's only natural he would know about it.

00:21:53.460 --> 00:21:56.920
Wataru told me what happened in Seiran.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:22:02.840
I reported it to the government
insofar as it doesn't affect our efforts.

00:22:02.840 --> 00:22:04.590
Was that a good idea?

00:22:04.590 --> 00:22:09.180
Your family owns Spring Pharmaceuticals.

00:22:09.180 --> 00:22:11.390
That's why I did it.

00:22:11.390 --> 00:22:14.690
My accusation of treason
against my own family

00:22:14.690 --> 00:22:17.980
makes the government trust me even more.

00:22:17.980 --> 00:22:24.990
Plus, that research facility was built
after Karen and I suggested it to Seiran.

00:22:24.990 --> 00:22:26.370
Huh?
